
This directory is intended for PlatformIO Test Runner and project tests.

Wi-Fi provisioning/recovery checks:
- `node test/wifi_provisioning_contract_test.js`
- `node test/wifi_recovery_contract_test.js`
- The recovery test executes the firmware's pure timer decision expression and checks
  worker isolation, dual-provider evidence, stale-result guards and AP-only settings.
  It does not replace the real-device AP/Internet-loss acceptance check.

Unit Testing is a software testing method by which individual units of
source code, sets of one or more MCU program modules together with associated
control data, usage procedures, and operating procedures, are tested to
determine whether they are fit for use. Unit testing finds problems early
in the development cycle.

More information about PlatformIO Unit Testing:
- https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html

Google Sheets Apps Script regression checks:
- `node test/google_sheets_daily_summary_test.js`
- `node test/google_sheets_ui_mode_test.js`
- `node test/google_sheets_newest_first_test.js`
- `node test/google_sheets_charts_resilience_test.js`
